+# Plan — project-wide pytest suite for python-multimodule
+
+## Test files (under `tests/`)
+- `test_stats.py` — `mean` average and empty-input error; `percentile` empty and range
+  errors, 0/100 boundaries, ordering of unsorted input, and the 50th percentile.
+- `test_window.py` — `RateWindow` non-positive-capacity error, empty average/peak
+  RuntimeError, average/peak before rollover, and capacity rollover dropping the oldest sample.
+- `test_slug.py` — separator collapsing/trimming, unchanged slug within max length,
+  over-length truncation with trailing-hyphen stripping, and invalid `max_length`.
+
+## Acceptance mapping
+Every named behavior maps to one test; concrete expected values are asserted (means,
+percentiles, averages, peaks, and slugs) rather than existence-only checks.
+
+## Quality review
+`pytest -q` from `fixtures/python-multimodule/` is green (17 tests). Cases are
+nonredundant and bounded to the three requested modules.
